                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[list][*][b][h1]Morlan's shorts:[/h1][/b][/list]\nThis game completely disregards PC users with a keyboard: \n\"Arrow keys or WASD to move. Space or K to jump. J to fire. L to plant seeds. I to swing knife. O to slide. Q/E to cycle seeds. Enter to pause. Shift to climb\". Who does that?? Keys are not redefinable, there are [b]NO[/b] options whatsoever for [b]anything[/b] and ESc immediately exits the game to the desktop. It's practically unplayable with a keyboard. Sometimes I wonder why I even bother.. I pressed Esc. Those are idle hours. \n\n[b]Don't waste more time reading lengthy reviews.. time is of the essence![/b]",
